# Deploy list on every production change

Production deploys via GitHub Actions **fast mode** (`scripts/github-cpanel-fileman-deploy-core.py`), not full `git pull` on the server.

## Automatic (preferred)

Fast deploy **uploads any file changed in the commit** under these paths (if the file exists in the repo):

- `includes/`, `pages/`, `control-panel/`, `js/`, `css/`, `api/`, `config/env/`, `public/`
- Root: `.htaccess`, `index.php`, `ratib-profile-fix.php`

No manual list edit needed for most edits in those folders.

## Always sync every push (baseline)

`FAST_FILES` in `scripts/github-cpanel-fileman-deploy-core.py` — keep `public/ratib-build.txt` **last**. Add here only files that must ship on **every** push even when unchanged (nav shell, home, sidebar, build marker).

## cPanel git hook / manual full sync

Also add the same paths to `CRITICAL_FILES` in `scripts/cpanel-deploy-sync.sh` when they are required for server-side `git pull` sync.

## Do not auto-deploy

- `Designed/` (unless user explicitly asks)
- `.github/`, `.cursor/`, `archive/`, `node_modules/`, `*.md`, secrets (`.env`, `*secrets*`)

## After changing deploy scripts

Push to `main` and confirm the Actions deploy job is green.
